eusoilvoc:SoilSurfaceSealFormation a skos:Concept ;
    # Scope qualification: This textbook explicitly treats crust and surface seal together. The candidate follows that local terminology.
    # Index-guided textbook definition: printed page(s) 153, 159; supported_paraphrase.
